<%- include("partials/head") %>
<%- include("partials/header") %>

<main>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell detail-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Parent waiver</p>
        <h1>Complete the waiver step before participation is finalized.</h1>
        <p class="page-intro">
          The waiver is part of the booking follow-up flow for youth participation. Completing it early helps keep arrival and check-in simple on session day.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/contact">Request Waiver Help</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/clinics">View Clinics</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-panel">
        <article class="mini-stat">
          <span>Required for</span>
          <strong>Booked clinic participation</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="mini-stat">
          <span>Best timing</span>
          <strong>As soon as you book</strong>
        </article>
        <article class="mini-stat">
          <span>Need help?</span>
          <strong>Use the contact path</strong>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell detail-grid">
      <article class="content-card">
        <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">How the waiver workflow works</p>
          <h2>One more step to keep session day smooth.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="info-stack">
          <article class="checklist-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Step 1</p>
            <h3>Save the booking.</h3>
            <p>Booking or reservation details are captured first so the family stays in the system right away.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="checklist-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">Step 2</p>
            <h3>Complete the parent waiver.</h3>
            <p>Waiver completion is part of the participation workflow before on-ice attendance is finalized.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>Reference your player name and clinic when you reach out</li>
          <li>Use the contact page if you need the waiver link resent or clarified</li>
          <li>Keep the process moving early so session-day check-in is easier</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <aside class="form-panel">
        <div class="form-intro-box">
          <p class="eyebrow">Need waiver help?</p>
          <ul class="form-trust-list">
            <li>Questions can be routed through the contact form</li>
            <li>Include your player name and clinic so follow-up is faster</li>
            <li>You can still view clinics while the waiver step is being handled</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/contact">Contact the program</a>
          <a class="button button-ghost" href="/clinics">View clinics</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include("partials/cta-strip") %>
</main>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
